//       + per-metal detail screen (selector chips, purity grid).
//  iOS STAGING: ios-v0.16.0-stg+100 (ASC highest 99) — metals page +
//       converter units + refresh fixes against backend v0.5.47-stg.
//  iOS STAGING: ios-v0.16.0-stg+101 (ASC highest 100) — catalog
//       self-heal (metal picker gains XPT/XPD on existing installs).
//  iOS PROD: ios-v0.16.0+102 (ASC highest 101) — metals UI + backend
